      "mergedPostDetails": "Near clip setting not working correctly anymore.\n\nExample:\n\n1. Launch VRChat and join a world where near clip set to 0.01 via reference camera. Confirm that Near clip setting is set to Off and in game actual value is 0.01.\n\n2. Change setting to Dynamic - near clip still 0.01 - this looks correct.\n\n3. Change setting to Forced - near clip now 0.001 that still looks correct.\n\n4. Now go back to Dynamic and then Off (click left arrow) - in both modes near clip stays at 0.001 value that's incorrect.\n\n5. Click Left arrow one more time to switch from Off to Forced and observe near clip value changing from 0.001 to 0.01 in Forced mode. At this point value is completely broken.\n\nAvatar ID avtr_2fbd5892-883e-4b14-a22e-9b2dadb54399 can be used to see near clip value in game. Action menu Misc and Shaders/RandomInfo.\n\nThis bug was introduced few builds before current live build.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1648] Near Clip setting completely broken",
