  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Forced Camera Near Distance setting is inconsistent with the value shown in the menu and the value actually applied. \n\nFor example, the setting may appear to be Off, but Forced is actually applied, or vice versa, the setting may appear to be Forced, but is actually Off.\n\nThe result seems to be different when switching with the right arrow and when switching with the left arrow.",
